sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Employee as User / Employee
    participant UI as Frontend (React 19)
    participant Nginx as Nginx Proxy
    participant FastAPIMain as FastAPI (main.py)
    participant RateLimiter as Rate Limit (Redis)
    participant AuthGuard as Auth & RBAC (deps.py)
    participant AttendanceRouter as Attendance Router
    participant BioService as Biometrics & AI Service
    participant Database as PostgreSQL (pgvector)
    participant AuditLog as Blockchain / Audit Engine
    participant Notify as Notification Engine

    Employee->>UI: Present Face at Webcam Clock-In
    Note over UI: MediaPipe verifies face presence & landmarks
    UI->>Nginx: POST /api/v1/attendance/verify-checkin (Image Base64/Multipart)
    Nginx->>FastAPIMain: Forward Request with Headers
    FastAPIMain->>RateLimiter: Check IP Sliding Window (100 req/min)
    RateLimiter-->>FastAPIMain: Allow
    FastAPIMain->>AuthGuard: Validate Bearer JWT & Session JTI
    AuthGuard->>Database: Query User & Active UserSession
    Database-->>AuthGuard: User & Org Context
    AuthGuard-->>AttendanceRouter: Authorized (user_id, org_id)

    AttendanceRouter->>BioService: Verify Liveness & Extract Embedding (128-dim)
    Note over BioService: Anti-spoof analysis & Facenet embedding
    BioService-->>AttendanceRouter: Embedding Vector + Liveness Confirmed

    AttendanceRouter->>Database: Query HNSW Cosine Distance (<-> operator)
    Note over Database: SELECT user_id FROM face_embeddings WHERE org_id=:org ORDER BY embedding <-> :vector LIMIT 1
    Database-->>AttendanceRouter: Matched User & Distance (< 0.40 threshold)

    AttendanceRouter->>Database: Check Cooldown (5 min) & Fetch Shift Rules
    Database-->>AttendanceRouter: Eligible for Clock-in

    AttendanceRouter->>Database: INSERT INTO attendance_logs (status='present', timestamp=NOW())
    Database-->>AttendanceRouter: Log Created (log_id)

    opt Blockchain Audit Anchoring Enabled
        AttendanceRouter->>AuditLog: Anchor Hash to Smart Contract (Web3)
        AuditLog-->>AttendanceRouter: Tx Hash Recorded
    end

    AttendanceRouter->>Notify: Dispatch In-Memory Event (Clock-in Success)
    Notify-->>AttendanceRouter: Event Queued

    AttendanceRouter-->>FastAPIMain: 200 OK (Checkin Successful, timestamp, user)
    FastAPIMain-->>Nginx: 200 OK + Process-Time Header
    Nginx-->>UI: 200 OK JSON Response
    UI-->>Employee: Display Attendance Confirmation & Status Badge
